@startuml
!include style.iuml
title 统一 443 入口与旧端口兼容
left to right direction
actor "新 Clash / V2Ray 订阅" as fresh
actor "未更新的旧客户端" as legacy
actor "HTTPS 订阅 / 网站" as https
component "旧端口 TCP 转发器\nPROXY v2：原端口与源 IP" as forwarder
component "HAProxy :443\n按 SNI 与原端口分流" as gateway
component "独立用户 UUID\nREALITY 入站 / Unix socket" as modern
component "旧端口兼容 REALITY 入站\nUnix socket" as compatible
component "原 HTTPS 服务\n127.0.0.1:18443" as web
fresh --> gateway
legacy --> forwarder
forwarder --> gateway : 来自 127.0.0.2 的内部 PROXY 头
https --> gateway
gateway --> modern : REALITY SNI / 新连接
gateway --> compatible : REALITY SNI / 原端口
gateway --> web : 其他 SNI
note bottom of gateway
公网连接不接受客户端伪造的 PROXY 头。
end note

@enduml
